      <section class="mp-listing-section">
        <h2 class="mp-listing-section-title" data-testid="Overview">Overview</h2>
        <div class="mp-listing-description"><h2>Streamlined Email Data Management with Google Sheets Integration</h2>
<p>Discover the power of streamlined email data management with this template that allows you to extract the latest 1000 emails from your Gmail account from the current month, and collate them into a structured <strong>Google Sheets report</strong>. Gain valuable insights from important email attributes, such as:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Sender information</strong></li>
<li><strong>Reception date</strong></li>
<li><strong>Priority level</strong></li>
<li><strong>Subject lines</strong></li>
<li><strong>CC recipients</strong></li>
<li><strong>Email body content</strong></li>
<li><strong>Attachments associated with each message</strong></li>
